<title>USA: Aviation tax to be 10 percent, then drop.</title>
<headline>Aviation tax to be 10 percent, then drop.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aviation taxes would be 10 percent and then drop to 7.5 percent over three years under the budget agreement Congress hopes to reach with the White House Monday night, a Republican source said.</p>
<p>The source said per flight segment taxes would also rise from $2 to $3, and international arrival and departure taxes would be $12 each way.</p>
</text>
